<title>FRANCE: Constitutional Council backs French pensions law.</title>
<headline>Constitutional Council backs French pensions law.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Constitutional Council, the country's top constitutional authority, said on Friday that it had rejected a challenge by Socialist senators to recently adopted legislation allowing private pension funds in France.</p>
</text>
